  "rawText": "Cornbread\n- 1.5 cups flour\n- 1.5 cups medium cornmeal\n- 1 cup sugar\n- 1 tsp baking soda\n- 1/2 tsp salt\n- 3/4 cup butter (1.5 sticks)\n- 3 eggs\n- 1.5 cups buttermilk\n\nMelt butter in skillet at 375. Take out and pour in batter. Cook 25-30 min."
